From: czyt <czytcn@gmail.com>
Subject: Upgrade Docker Go builder to 1.26

SiYuan v3.7.2 requires Go 1.26 in kernel/go.mod, while the tagged
Dockerfile still uses Go 1.25.

diff --git a/Dockerfile b/Dockerfile
--- a/Dockerfile
+++ b/Dockerfile
@@ -23,7 +23,7 @@ mv appearance stage guide /artifacts/
 if [ -d changelogs ]; then mv changelogs /artifacts/; fi
 EORUN
 
-FROM golang:1.25-alpine AS go-build
+FROM golang:1.26-alpine AS go-build
 
 RUN <<EORUN
 #!/bin/sh -e
